# Only what the build needs; everything else stays out of the build context.
# The Dockerfile must stay in: `docker compose` builds through bake, which applies these
# rules to the Dockerfile too ("failed to read dockerfile" otherwise).
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!src/
!tools/
!docker/nginx.conf
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
